<title>MALAYSIA: Ringgit loses gains ahead of trade data.</title>
<headline>Ringgit loses gains ahead of trade data.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Previous	Forecast	Resistance    Support</p>
<p>    2.5085/5160   2.5080/5120    2.5050	 2.5150</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>* Ringgit recovers on buying after market fails to break 2.5150 a dollar overnight</p>
<p>* Loses part of gains to fresh dollar buying on dips</p>
<p>* Rumour of February trade deficit or surplus</p>
<p>* Most activity due to ringgit/Sing cross play</p>
<p>The ringgit was off morning highs as people returned to the dollar after a nearly 70-point gain for the Malaysian unit, dealers said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
